# Check out every text file with LF on all platforms. Tools that round-trip
# files (tauri-cli rewrites src-tauri/Cargo.toml during Windows builds) emit
# LF, and a CRLF working copy would make the release workflow's
# clean-checkout provenance check flag them as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.dmg binary
*.gz binary
